    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Did you hear about that drunkard finally falling off the bridge? It was just a matter of time...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ти чув про п'яницю, який нарешті впав з мосту? Це було лише питанням часу...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Watch your back, kid, there's danger lurking behind every corner.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Слідкуй за спиною, хлопче, небезпека чаїться за кожним рогом.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Whatcha doing here?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Що ти тут робиш?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Don't make any sudden moves.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не роби різких рухів.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>After that motioner slaughter, I think I'll stop getting in Motion for a while.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Після тієї різанини в Motion, думаю, я на деякий час перестану ходити в Motion.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's quite easy to get hurt in Drop Zone. ::Laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Досить легко отримати травму в Drop Zone. ::Сміється.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Did you hear about Chemical Agent's defeat?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ти чув про поразку Chemical Agent?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The Oligarchy brought us this misery. Curse them!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Олігархія принесла нам це лихо. Прокляття їм!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I remember the plague outbreak a few years ago. We got hit pretty bad.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я пам'ятаю спалах чуми кілька років тому. На нас сильно налягло.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I should get myself in Motion again...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мені варто знову піти в Motion...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm starvin' for some barrel soup!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я помираю за тарілку супу з бочок!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Avoid the edges.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Уникайте країв.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>How about a kiss, sweetie?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Як щодо поцілунку, сонечко?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q15" name="=&gt;q15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>So, Eddie boy got zoned out. ::Laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Отже, Едді хлопця вигнали з зони. ::Сміється.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
